  * CLI: --inspect-config — dump fully-resolved effective config as
    JSON to stdout, exit 0. AI-friendly pass extension #2.

    Surfaces the same merged values that would feed into --slice, but
    BEFORE burning a slice cycle. Output: source_presets (the raw
    --load-settings/--load-filaments/--datadir paths), config (every
    resolved key/value of m_print_config, ~600 entries), summary
    (key counts).

    Catches the preset-inheritance class of bug that bit us several
    times today (the gyroid-in-the-gcode-header surprise where the
