    Runs after preset loading AND after any --calibrate-type
    overrides, so --inspect-config --calibrate-type flow-yolo-...
    shows the post-YOLO-override config — verifies the calib
    generator did its job.

    Sanity: with Klipper Cube Test + ANYCUBIC PLA HS = 658 keys
    surfaces user preset values; no presets = 611 default keys.

